[00:04.95]As whispers ride the wind in my ears
{"耳畔细语随风轻吟"}
[00:10.24]Dusk has brought the dawn of my fears
{"暮色带来恐惧的黎明"}
[00:15.29]The gale devoured the heavens and the light
{"狂风吞噬了苍穹与光明"}
[00:20.09]Enshrined in shadow, a tomb built of night
{"阴影供奉 筑起夜的墓陵"}
[00:25.12]
[00:25.38]Strike my blade in rhythm with the storm
{"让剑刃与风暴同频共振"}
[00:29.89]Entwined by fate, summon the ashen swarm
{"命运交织 召唤灰烬之群"}
[00:35.14]If freedom must be wrought by waves
{"若自由需以浪涛铸就"}
[00:39.78]Let this crown melt to dust and be carried away
{"就让这王冠化尘随风飘走"}
[00:44.78]
[00:44.96]So let the gale become one with me
{"让狂风与我合为一体"}
[00:49.82]Follow me, the dawn will rise
{"跟随我 黎明终将升起"}
[00:54.85]As they kneel before their deity
{"当他们跪拜神明之际"}
[00:59.81]I will fight to turn the tide
{"我将奋战扭转这潮汐"}
[01:06.34]
[01:06.57]And rage against the night
{"向黑夜宣泄怒意"}
[01:09.95]
[01:10.14]The air enfolds around me
{"气流环绕我身际"}
[01:13.32](in a tempest rife with light)
{"（在光芒四射的风暴中）"}
[01:14.96]I'll go and I'll open up the skies
{"我将前往并撕开天际"}
[01:19.91](to rage against the night)
{"（向黑夜宣泄怒火）"}
[01:21.56]As the gale grows, I bellow a fervent battle cry
{"风暴愈烈 我发出炽热战吼"}
[01:27.41]I'll find our way out, right through the eye
{"穿越风暴之眼找到出口"}
[01:33.10]The eye of the storm
{"风暴之眼中央"}
[01:35.25]
[01:35.58]My gaze affixed on the stars trapped above
{"目光锁定被困的星辰"}
[01:41.03]Their light as faint as the prayers I bear with love
{"微光如我携爱的祈祷般朦胧"}
[01:47.73]When the shadows of the past find their grave
{"当往昔阴影入土为安"}
[01:54.36]And the echoes of our souls sink 'neath the waves
{"灵魂回响沉入浪涛之下"}
[02:01.05]I will stand resolute at the edge with you
{"我与你并肩伫立边缘 坚定不移"}
[02:06.29]Against the dying of the light
{"抗争那渐熄的光芒"}
[02:08.09]
[02:08.25]The air enfolds around me
{"空气将我温柔包裹"}
[02:13.14](as a tempest filled with light)
{"（在充满光芒的风暴中）"}
[02:14.53]I'll go and open up the skies
{"我将去撕裂苍穹"}
[02:20.08](and rage against the night)
{"（并向黑夜宣泄怒火）"}
[02:20.24]As the gale grows, I bellow a fervent battle cry
{"当狂风怒号　我迸发炽热战吼"}
[02:27.84]I'll find our way out of the storm
{"我会找到穿越风暴的出路"}
[02:34.79]We'll go straight through the eye
{"我们将直抵风眼中央"}
[02:38.53]
[02:39.37]I will stand
{"我会屹立不倒"}
[02:44.01]And I will wait
{"我会静候于此"}
[02:48.81]At the edge
{"在悬崖边缘"}
[02:54.12]I will wait
{"我会等待"}
[02:58.62]As the day wains
{"当白昼将尽"}
[03:03.74]At the edge
{"在绝境之畔"}
[03:08.50]An iris blooms
{"虹膜之花绽放"}
[03:13.36]
[03:14.25]So let the gale become one with me
{"就让狂风与我合为一体"}
[03:19.45]Follow me the dawn will rise
{"跟随我　黎明终将升起"}
[03:24.45]As they kneel before their deity
{"当他们跪拜在神祇面前"}
[03:29.45]I will fight to turn the tide
{"我将奋战扭转乾坤"}
[03:37.02]The air enfolds around me
{"空气将我温柔包裹"}
[03:42.59](in a tempest filled with light)
{"（在充满光芒的风暴中）"}
[03:43.76]I'll go and open up the skies
{"我将去撕裂苍穹"}
[03:48.58](and rage against the night)
{"（并向黑夜宣泄怒火）"}
[03:50.59]As the gale grows, we know the storm we will defy
{"当狂风肆虐　我们誓要征服这场风暴"}
[03:56.54]We'll find our way out
{"我们会找到出路"}
[03:59.38](I'll find our way out)
{"（我会找到出路）"}
[04:02.49]Right into the eye
{"直面风暴之眼"}
[04:05.83]
[04:06.45]Defy the storm
{"无惧狂风暴雨"}
[04:10.35]Our world reforms
{"世界重塑新生"}
[04:15.25]At the world's edge
{"在世界尽头处"}
[04:20.21]An iris blooms
{"虹膜绽放光芒"}
